                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{align*}E(X)&=(-1)b+0b+1b+2\\left(\\frac35-b\\right)+3\\left(\\frac{3b}{5}\\right)\\\\E(X)&=\\frac65-\\frac b5\\\\E(X)&=\\frac65-\\frac{2}{65}\\\\E(X)&=\\frac{76}{65}\\end{align*}",
